      "Title": "XIV.Packages.InventorySystem.ScriptableObjects.ItemSO<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/XIV.Packages.InventorySystem.ScriptableObjects.ItemSO-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">An abstract class to connect primitive items to Unity.\nAny non-serializable object can be stored in this class.</p>\n<example>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-csharp\">// Define a class that contains required values for your item.\npublic class SwordItem : ItemBase\n{\n    public int damage;\n    public float swingSpeed;\n}\n// Create another class to allow creating SwordItem in the Editor.\n[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"Items/\" + nameof(SwordItemSO))]\npublic class SwordItemSO : ItemSO&lt;SwordItem&gt;\n{\n}</code></pre>\n</example>\n"
